escription\n- Preserve two exact point-consistency defect bounds and exact\n  discarded-mass restoration in two auxiliary modules, with imports and\n  matching auxiliary blueprint entries.\n- Retain qualified historical audit and event archives, including the\n  failed fixture checks and earlier effort. The original public PR and\n  issue remain available for a separate disposition after integration.\n- Refresh the existing preservation commit `d831db9b` by an ordinary merge\n  to `5ae31941`. Both added Lean module blobs are unchanged. This change\n  does not complete the source line-consistency theorem.\n\n### Testing\n- The original preservation packet passed focused Lean, targeted module\n  builds, root import, three fresh standard-only axiom closures, blueprint\n  render/sync/citations/checkdecls and normal commit hooks. Historical\n  excerpts were checked byte for byte; evidence is retained in the\n  preservation receipt and manifest.\n- MAIN verified the clean refreshed head, ordered merge parents, unchanged\n  added Lean modules and current freshness. Normal publication gates and\n  exact-head CI are running; independent review remains pending.\n\n---\nAddresses #515\n", "created_at": "2026-09-18T02:48:27Z", "updated_at": "2026-09-18T02:48:30Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": "5ed1eaf44ce5fed91aff9576e19a3591f7ec8079", "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "labels": [{"id": 12025010884, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8axA", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/formalization", "name": "formalization", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Lean formalization of a mathematical statement", "archived_at": null, "archived_by": null}, {"id": 12025012183, "node_id": "LA_kwDOUJyJf88AAAACzL8f1w", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Dengnifer/MIPStarRE-A/labels/qpbt-analysis", "name": "qpbt-analysis", "color": "ededed", "default": false, "description": "Soundness/rigid